   Guerrero-Analco, Jose Antonio and Perez-Perez, Rosa Emilia and
   Sanchez-Coronado, Maria Esther and Colin, Paola Martinez and Mehltreter,
   Klaus},
Title = {Impact of longevity and wettability of fern leaves on epiphyll
   colonization in a Mexican lowland rainforest},
