Abstract = {uvby - beta photoelectric photometry of stars in the direction of the
   open clusters IC 4665, NGC 6871 and Dzim 5 is presented. From this uvby
   - beta photometry we classified the spectral types which allowed us to
   determine the reddening and, hence, the distance. Membership of the
   stars to the cluster was determined. Our results are compared with those
   obtained by GAIA DR2.},
