Abstract = {Females of two species of the genus Lasaia Bates, 1868, L. arsis
   Staudinger, {[}1887] and L. pseudomeris Clench, 1972 are described from
   specimens deposited in entomological collections. The identity of these
   species had been uncertain due to scarcity of data, causing
