   species for science. This taxonomic entity has similarity with H.
   graminifolia. However, it is distinguished from the latter by presenting
   wider leaves (1.9-2.2(-2.8) vs. 0.5-0.7 cm), much longer floral tubes
   (12-14.2 vs. ca. 4 cm), longer anthers (ca. 2 vs. 1.4 cm), and ovaries
   with four ovules in each locule (4 vs. 2).},
